{
 "duration": 139.159375,
 "units": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "beat": 0,
   "chapter": "Intro",
   "text": "It is five thirty in the morning and I have not moved for three hours.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 4.177
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "beat": 1,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "My mother is in the chair by my window.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 4.627,
   "end": 6.821
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "beat": 1,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "My father is propped against the foot of my bed.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 7.121,
   "end": 9.737
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "beat": 1,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Both of them are facing me.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 10.037,
   "end": 11.712
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "beat": 1,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Both of their mouths are open.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 12.012,
   "end": 13.79
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "beat": 2,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Neither of them has blinked since I woke up, and the thing that arranged them has not left this room.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 14.24,
   "end": 19.868
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "beat": 3,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "At twenty past two I woke up to a scream on the other side of the house.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 20.318,
   "end": 24.579
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "beat": 3,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It stopped in the middle, like a door had been shut on it.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 24.879,
   "end": 27.891
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "beat": 4,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I got as far as my door.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 28.341,
   "end": 29.896
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "beat": 4,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Then I did the stupidest thing I will ever do.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 30.196,
   "end": 33.033
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "beat": 4,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I went to the bathroom first.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 33.333,
   "end": 34.912
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "beat": 5,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Three minutes.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 35.362,
   "end": 36.258
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "beat": 5,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I put the light on, I washed my hands, and I opened the door a crack.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 36.558,
   "end": 40.845
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "beat": 6,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "There was blood on the carpet.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 41.295,
   "end": 42.785
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "beat": 6,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Not a drop.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 43.085,
   "end": 43.991
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "beat": 6,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "A smear, dragged from my parents' room all the way to the top of the stairs.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 44.291,
   "end": 48.499
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "beat": 7,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "The front door was twelve steps down those stairs.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 48.949,
   "end": 51.567
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "beat": 7,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I did not take them.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 51.867,
   "end": 53.057
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "beat": 8,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "I got into my bed and pulled the sheets over my head.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 53.507,
   "end": 56.701
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "beat": 9,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Then my bedroom door creaked open, and I pulled the blanket down off one eye.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 57.151,
   "end": 61.81
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "beat": 10,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It was bent over in my doorway and it was far too tall for my room.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 62.26,
   "end": 66.384
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "beat": 11,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Hairless.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 66.834,
   "end": 67.545
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "beat": 11,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "No eyes.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 67.845,
   "end": 68.731
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "beat": 11,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "No mouth.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 69.031,
   "end": 69.894
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "beat": 11,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Nothing on its face at all.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 70.194,
   "end": 71.823
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "beat": 12,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Arms hanging past its knees.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 72.273,
   "end": 74.02
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "beat": 12,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Back slouched right over.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 74.32,
   "end": 75.769
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "beat": 12,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Wearing nothing.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 76.069,
   "end": 76.986
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "beat": 13,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "And it was dragging my mother and my father in by the arms, one in each hand.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 77.436,
   "end": 82.172
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "beat": 14,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It propped my father against my bed, facing my pillow.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 82.622,
   "end": 86.106
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "beat": 14,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Then it sat my mother in the chair, turned the same way.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 86.406,
   "end": 89.52
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "beat": 15,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It arranged them, like something that wanted the picture to come out right.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 89.97,
   "end": 93.982
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "beat": 16,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Then it put both hands on my wall and painted a circle, and a star inside the circle, upside down.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 94.432,
   "end": 100.658
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "beat": 17,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Then it dragged one line of letters underneath it with one finger.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 101.108,
   "end": 104.731
  },
  {
   "i": 34,
   "beat": 17,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It was too dark to read.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 105.031,
   "end": 106.49
  },
  {
   "i": 35,
   "beat": 18,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "And then it folded itself up on my floor and went under my bed.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 106.94,
   "end": 110.72
  },
  {
   "i": 36,
   "beat": 18,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Under my bed, with me on top of it.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 111.02,
   "end": 113.088
  },
  {
   "i": 37,
   "beat": 19,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "That was three hours ago.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 113.538,
   "end": 115.017
  },
  {
   "i": 38,
   "beat": 19,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Lie still that long and your eyes get better at the dark.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 115.317,
   "end": 118.437
  },
  {
   "i": 39,
   "beat": 20,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "So I move my eyes.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 118.887,
   "end": 120.281
  },
  {
   "i": 40,
   "beat": 20,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Not my head.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 120.581,
   "end": 121.572
  },
  {
   "i": 41,
   "beat": 20,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "Just my eyes.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 121.872,
   "end": 123.001
  },
  {
   "i": 42,
   "beat": 20,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "And I can read it now.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 123.301,
   "end": 124.643
  },
  {
   "i": 43,
   "beat": 21,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It says: I know you're awake.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 125.093,
   "end": 126.747
  },
  {
   "i": 44,
   "beat": 22,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It never had to check.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 127.197,
   "end": 128.534
  },
  {
   "i": 45,
   "beat": 22,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "It wrote that before I opened my eyes, and it has waited three hours for me to read it.",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 128.834,
   "end": 134.003
  },
  {
   "i": 46,
   "beat": 23,
   "chapter": null,
   "text": "If you were in that bed, would you have stayed still, or run for the door?",
   "who": "nar",
   "start": 134.453,
   "end": 137.959
  }
 ]
}